    {
      "association_text": "B. bifidum was significantly enriched in stool samples of patients with non-small-cell lung cancer (NSCLC) who responded to cancer therapeutics (partial response) compared to non-responders, as determined by 16S rRNA LEfSe analysis and confirmed by quantitative PCR (P=0.0022).",
