        33432149
      ]
    },
    {
      "association_text": "B. bifidum abundance remained significantly higher in NSCLC responders compared to non-responders even after excluding EGFR TKI-treated patients (P=0.0128), supporting a treatment-agnostic association between B. bifidum enrichment and therapeutic response.",
